  DEAD SNIPPET — do not render, and delete it: `git rm snippets/fye-description.liquid`.

  This held the W335 live-price logic for a few hours on 10/09/2026 and shipped
  a bug. A `capture` around a `render` HTML-escapes the snippet's output, so
  "wedding & eternity" came back already escaped, the `| escape` on the meta
  tag made it "&amp;amp;", and every page with an ampersand in its description
  advertised a literal "&amp;" to Google.

  The logic now lives inline in layout/theme.liquid as an `assign`, which does
  not escape. The comment there explains what it does and why it must not be
  turned back into a snippet.
